<title>UK: Raisio expects capital boost longer term.</title>
<headline>Raisio expects capital boost longer term.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Finnish food, animal feed and chemicals group Raision Tehtaat Oy expects a share capital increase longer term as it develops its cholesterol-reducing Benecol product, a senior executive said on Thursday.</p>
<p>&quot;Of course, we must increase out share capital ... in the long run,&quot; deputy chief executive Jukka Maki told Reuters Financial Television in an interview.</p>
<p>Asked when Raisio expected to see real growth in profit on the product, he said: &quot;I think we will have to wait another one and a half years -- something like that -- before we can see a real profit-maker. Now we are investing so much,&quot; he said.</p>
</text>
